# Contextualising PhenotypeR results

## Contextualising PhenotypeR results



```{r, message=TRUE}
hypertension_exp <- getCohortExpectations(chat_medgemma,
                                         "hypertension", 
                                         tempdir())
hypertension_exp
```



## Contextualising PhenotypeR results



```{r, message=TRUE}
hypertension_exp <- getCohortExpectations(chat_medgemma,
                                         c("Primary hypertension",
                                           "Secondary hypertension",
                                           "Resistant hypertension"), 
                                         tempdir())
hypertension_exp
```

```{r, message=TRUE}
hypertension_exp |> 
  filter(estimate == "Median age of incident cases") |> 
  select(cohort_name, value)
```

```{r, message=TRUE}
hypertension_exp |> 
  filter(estimate == "Percentage male") |> 
  select(cohort_name, value)
```

